\">＝2a：2b＝a：b<br>∴△ABO～△CDO（SAS）　∴甲丙相似<br>△BOC　與△AOD　中，∠BOC＝∠AOD<br><img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r184.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r185.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝a：2b≠<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r186.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r187.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝b：2a　∴乙丁不相似","k":["96年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800403","s":"以下是甲、乙兩人證明<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r188.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r189.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r190.svg\" width=\"51\" alt=\"附圖\">的過程：<br>(甲)因為<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r191.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r192.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3，<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r193.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r194.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<br>所以<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r195.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r196.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＞3＋2＝5<br>且<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r197.svg\" width=\"51\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r198.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r199.svg\" width=\"33\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5<br>所以<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r200.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r201.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＞5＞<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r202.svg\" width=\"51\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r203.svg\" width=\"144\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(乙)作一個直角三角形，兩股長分別為<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r204.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r205.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>利用商高定理（<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r206.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＋（<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r207.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝15＋8<br>得斜邊長為<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r208.svg\" width=\"51\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>因為<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r209.svg\" width=\"142\" alt=\"附圖\">為此三角形的三邊長<br>所以<img src=\"img/9beb6d_y96-1_r210.svg\" width=\"